WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.900
This concept animation traces the floor, walls and columns of a lobby.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Points settle onto the geometry to reveal the lobby’s appearance.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.900
Adding time brings the robot and moving pedestrians into the same space.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.500
An overhead view follows the trail to the X-Nav title.
